Privacy note
- Don’t share your full SSN in email messages. If a form requests an SSN, providing only what's required (and via secure forms) is safer; use the last 4 digits when possible for less-sensitive references.

If you tell me your passport expiry date and your travel dates (and nationality if not U.S.), I’ll tell you whether it meets the 3‑month rule and whether you should renew to be safe for a 6‑month recommendation.

