- If you need to renew, you can often do so by mail (DS‑82) if eligible or in person (DS‑11) if not. Expedited processing is available (add fees); for urgent travel there are appointment options at regional passport agencies (proof of travel required).
- Don’t share your full SSN in chat. You included the last four (that’s usually okay for identification), but avoid posting the whole SSN here.

If you give me your passport expiry and travel dates I’ll calculate whether it meets the 3‑ and 6‑month rules and recommend next steps (renewal timeline and options). I can also draft an email to the passport agency or to the airline/consulate if you want.

